sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / User
    participant Frontend as React Dropzone (/upload)
    participant API as FastAPI (/api/upload)
    participant Service as UploadService
    participant Extractor as Document Extractors
    participant DB as SQLite (documents table)
    participant Disk as Storage (backend/uploads/)

    User->>Frontend: Drag & drop file (PDF / PPTX / DOCX / TXT)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Client-side validation (type, size <= 25MB)
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/upload (multipart/form-data)
    API->>Service: handle_upload(UploadFile)
    
    Service->>Service: Validate extension & MIME type
    Service->>Disk: Persist file ({uuid}_{filename})
    
    alt File is PDF (.pdf)
        Service->>Extractor: PyMuPDF fitz.open(path)
        Extractor-->>Service: Return pages text & page markers
    else File is PPTX (.pptx)
        Service->>Extractor: python-pptx Presentation(path)
        Extractor-->>Service: Return slide text, notes & table cells
    else File is DOCX (.docx)
        Service->>Extractor: python-docx Document(path)
        Extractor-->>Service: Return paragraphs, headings & tables
    else File is TXT (.txt)
        Service->>Extractor: Decode UTF-8 (Latin-1 fallback)
        Extractor-->>Service: Return cleaned text
    end

    Service->>Service: Clean text, compute word/char/page counts
    Service->>DB: Insert record into documents table
    Service-->>API: Return DocumentMetadata & text_preview
    API-->>Frontend: HTTP 200 JSON ({file_id, page_count, word_count, preview})
    Frontend-->>User: Display "Text extracted" badge & generation settings
